{"text": " Rob\u00edm r\u00fdchlej\u0161\u00ed progres vo fitku ako v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ina natur\u00e1lou, prezrad\u00edm ti ako. S\u00fa to dva kroky, ktor\u00e9 sa stahuj\u00fa primarie na viackolbov\u00e9 \u0165a\u017eke cv\u00edky, ako snadka Drepia, cvi\u010d\u00edm Hakem Drepia Ardielka alebo k\u00fa\u0148a nejak\u00fd Tlakov\u00fd cv\u00edk ako je napr\u00edklad Benchpress. Prav\u00fd s t\u00fdchto krokov je, \u017ee na tento cv\u00edk cvi\u010d\u00edm iba jednu pracenu s\u00e9riu dvakra do t\u00fd\u017ed\u0148a. Zladovom k tomu, \u017ee sa jedna o \u0165a\u017eke cv\u00edky, na ktor\u00fdch sa cvi\u010d\u00ed s velk\u00fdmi v\u00e1hami, tak je jedna pracen\u00e1 s\u00e9ria do zlihania alebo bl\u00edzkoch zlihaniu, vie by\u0165 ve\u013emi vy\u010derp\u00e1vaj\u00faca. Tak\u00e9 by ich cvi\u010d\u00edm viac, jednak\u017ee by som na druh\u00e9j s\u00e9rii u\u017e podal o doslap\u0161\u00edm v\u00fdkon, ale takie\u017e by som vytvaral na vy\u0161\u0161et s v\u00e1loj po\u0161kodenie ajte daje cenec \u00fanavu, \u010do by z dlhodob\u00e9ho hlaviska vedelo negatyvne oflimit m\u00f4j v\u00fdkon kv\u00f4li regener\u00e1cii. Teraz ale neznamen\u00e1, \u017ee cvi\u010d\u00edm iba jednu s\u00e9riu na dan\u00fa partiu dvakra do t\u00fd\u017ed\u0148a, bav\u00edme sa o konkr\u00e9tnom cv\u00edk. Rob\u00edm to tak napr\u00edklad na hack-and-repoch, kde si potom e\u0161te prid\u00e1m jednu alebo dve s\u00e9rii na predkop\u00e1vanie a pod\u013ea toho vakom \u0161t\u00e1diu tr\u00e9ningu som. Daj\u00e1le pozoraj na t\u00fdchto dodatk\u00f3v\u00fdch cv\u00edkol, aby to neprep\u00e1valo, aby to nasaduj\u00facovho tr\u00e9ningu rovnak\u00e9 partie u\u017e bol regenerovan\u00e9. Krok \u010d\u00edslo 2, deka ktor\u00e9mu m\u00e1m r\u00fdchli progres, cvi\u010d\u00edm n\u00edzke po\u010dty opakovanie, ktor\u00fd som pre\u0161lo z typick\u00fdch 8 a\u017e 12 alebo 7 a\u017e 10 a\u017e 5 a\u017e 8 alebo do konca 4 a\u017e 7 moj progres sa rapidne z r\u00fdchudu. To je to d\u00e1va zmysel, \u010di v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ie po\u010dty opakovanie rob\u00ed\u0161, \u010di v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ie stv\u00e1\u013eov\u00e9 p\u00e1lenie pos\u0165ie\u0161, \u010di v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ie kardi\u00f3v\u00e1 sko\u013eare na roky tom\u00e1, \u010do s\u00fa v\u0161etko faktory, ktor\u00e9 negat\u00edvne ovplyv\u0148uj\u00fa tvoj v\u00fdkon. A teda aj schopno sprav\u00ed\u0165 progres na danej s\u00e9rie. Ak tie\u017e \u010di v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ie po\u010dty opakovanie rob\u00ed\u0161, \u010di vytvara\u0161 v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ie stv\u00e1\u013eov\u00e9 po\u0161kodenie, aj teda aj cenn\u00e9 z\u00fanavu, \u010do dok\u00e1\u017eu spomalova tvoju regener\u00e1cii. Ako podmienko tak\u00e9ho to cvi\u010denia je ovlada\u0165 spr\u00e1vn\u00fa tektiku na 100%, k\u00fdm do toho nem\u00e1\u0161 zm\u00e1knut\u00e9 tak\u00fdmto nie\u010d\u00edm za zate\u013en\u00fd tr\u00e1v. Tak\u017ee pokia\u013e ma\u0161 probl\u00e9m s progresom s tak\u00fdmto nejak\u00fdm n\u00e1ro\u010dincikom sk\u00fazan\u00edba jednu s\u00e9riu 2x do tie\u017e\u0148a po nejak\u00fdch 5 a\u017e 8 a\u017e 7 opakovanie dopom to nejak\u00fdmi zmyslu pln\u00fdmi cv\u00edky mi pozorala nepre\u017eento a uvid\u00ed\u0161, \u010do sa stane.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.0, "text": " Rob\u00edm r\u00fdchlej\u0161\u00ed progres vo fitku ako v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ina natur\u00e1lou, prezrad\u00edm ti ako.", "tokens": [50364, 5424, 14569, 367, 41845, 306, 73, 48651, 447, 45189, 1650, 3318, 5279, 43567, 12099, 10236, 7891, 1426, 26389, 11447, 263, 11, 659, 89, 6206, 14569, 8757, 43567, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3352757093641493, "compression_ratio": 1.5258358662613982, "no_speech_prob": 0.06388116627931595}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.0, "end": 8.0, "text": " S\u00fa to dva kroky, ktor\u00e9 sa stahuj\u00fa primarie na viackolbov\u00e9 \u0165a\u017eke cv\u00edky, ako snadka Drepia,", "tokens": [50564, 318, 2481, 281, 274, 2757, 45909, 4133, 11, 350, 21151, 526, 6